WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.590
Let's go next to our caller from the nine
one seven area code.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.560
Who's calling today from nine one seven?

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.780
Hey, David.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.350
This is Sam.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.190
Hey, Sam, what's going on?

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:17.750
So I'm right now I'm 19 years old and I try
to engage with a lot of my friends and talking

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.110
about political activism and stuff.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:25.039
But I feel like that the only thing that they
could talk about is the Instagram stories

00:00:25.039 --> 00:00:26.740
that they are reposting.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:31.100
And I can't really have educated discussions
with my friends because all they do is post

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:37.999
stuff on our Instagram stories of just headlines
with no real explanation or education, for

00:00:37.999 --> 00:00:40.199
that matter, just words.

00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:43.249
So I'm I'm having trouble engaging with my
friends.

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:45.359
And I've actually suggested your YouTube channel.

00:00:45.359 --> 00:00:50.670
And I'm just wondering, like, what is the
best way to engage with these Instagram activists

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:54.750
in real change besides posting something on
their Instagram stories?

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:59.729
So you when you say that they're posting Instagram
stories, their Instagram stories related to

00:00:59.729 --> 00:01:04.970
news and politics, but they're just basically
regurgitating headlines and not really diving

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.110
into the substance, it sounds like you're
saying.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.580
Exactly.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:14.710
And are they people who are aligned with you
politically or not aligned with you politically?

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:15.860
Yeah.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.220
Align with me politically.

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:22.210
And usually people who are posting stuff for
black lives matter for a Biden administration.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:28.340
But the way they do it is they're just posting
straight headlines with no real information

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.700
or articles supporting their ideas.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.500
So what I would ask in an empathetic way.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.560
And so the good thing is you're not trying
to change anyone's mind here.

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.520
These are already people who are on your side
politically.

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.410
You're just trying to get them to be better
activists.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.180
And so a couple different things.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.550
One, check out my interviews about political
hobby ism.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:51.000
I've done a couple of them which talks about
exactly this issue, which is following the

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.690
news and retweeting or posting stuff to Instagram.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.300
It's political hobby ism.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.840
It's not really activism.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:01.830
So first, I would check out those two interviews
to kind of understand the problem.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:07.160
Then I would consider going to them and saying,
what is it you would like people to do when

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.879
they see you post these stories?

00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:13.190
Like, clearly you're posting it because you
think it's important and you're posting it

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.090
because you want other people to see it.

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:19.790
What do you envision other people should be
doing and whatever it is they imagine other

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.639
people should be doing?

00:02:21.639 --> 00:02:24.010
That's probably what they should be doing
themselves.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.010
Right.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:28.480
So if they were to say, well, I posted so
that other people will get out there and be

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.640
in touch with their elected officials or run
for local office in order to make change.

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.300
Well, you could do that instead of just posting
to Instagram.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.300
Right.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.959
So I would I would let them tell you what
what action they think would be most useful

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:53.049
and then challenge them to go and do it themselves.

00:02:53.049 --> 00:03:09.969
All right.

00:03:09.969 --> 00:03:55.129
Thank you so much, David.

00:03:55.129 --> 00:04:06.969
All right, Sam, thank you.

00:04:06.969 --> 00:04:14.180
Appreciate the phone call.

